From f3819c21c17ebf106cf465e73972c467868cd9e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: carl0sfelipe <carlosfelipe2050@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:39:56 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] moe cache: hybrid mode (--moe-cache-hybrid)

Experts missing from the MoE cache run on the CPU instead of being uploaded
before the layer; the cache is filled in the background by a paced uploader
thread (64 KiB chunks, one in flight) on its own stream.

- ggml-cpu mul_mat_id: a negative expert id skips the row (zeros)
- graph: the MoE runs on the cache banks (non-resident experts read distinct
  zero slots) and on the host experts (resident ones are -1), summed
- single-token ubatches only; larger ones bypass the cache

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
